    <div class="sec-h" style="margin-top:26px"><h3 class="h17">就绪队列</h3><span class="subnote">依赖已齐、等槽位或额度（项管台账）</span></div>
    <div class="card r14" style="padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">${ready}</div>
